msgid "ARKV6X Flight Controller Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-v6x-overview.rst:11
#: a760d90e968e4f4a889669dcb1fd4ab3
msgid "The USA-built ARKV6X flight controller is based on the `FMUV6X and Pixhawk Autopilot Bus open source standards <https://github.com/pixhawk/Pixhawk-Standards>`__. With triple synced IMUs, data averaging, voting, and filtering is possible. The Pixhawk Autopilot Bus (PAB) form factor enables the ARKV6X to be used on any PAB-compatible carrier board, such as the `ARK Pixhawk Autopilot Bus Carrier <https://arkelectron.com/product/ark-pixhawk-autopilot-bus-carrier/>`__."
msgstr ""

